OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FManizha Bakhtari was posted to
OL,10,     FAustria as Afghan ambassador. When
OL,11,     Fthe Taliban seized power she
OL,12,     Frefused to budge and since 2021,
OL,13,     Fremains the country's only female
OL,14,     Fambassador.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1999, Canada's map was redrawn
OL,17,     Fto create Nunavut, a territory
OL,18,     Freflecting Inuit land rights. It
OL,19,     Ffollowed more than 20 years of
OL,20,     Fcampaigning.
